r.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/1673734406704355585' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1301275566"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2016 at 8:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3510314806467826021</id><published>2016-09-01T19:18:36.137-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-01T19:18:36.137-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Make the title &amp;quot;Whiners and Losers&amp;quot;, and...</title><content type='html'>Make the title &amp;quot;Whiners and Losers&amp;quot;, and you&amp;#39;d hit the mark.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;B Woodman&lt;br /&gt;III-per</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/3510314806467826021'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/3510314806467826021'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/08/winners-and-losers-in-culture-war.html?showComment=1472775516137#c3510314806467826021' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/08/winners-and-losers-in-culture-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1673734406704355585' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/1673734406704355585' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1752828345"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2016 at 7:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3440254957222418897</id><published>2016-09-01T11:40:28.750-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-01T11:40:28.750-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Why were you shocked, Stones?  So-called &amp;quot;Con...</title><content type='html'>Why were you shocked, Stones?  So-called &amp;quot;Conservatives&amp;quot; are generally quick to advocate the abridgment of the rights of anyone who doesn&amp;#39;t agree with their brand of god, their morals, or their world view.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s really sad that they don&amp;#39;t see the value in ignoring the actions of other&amp;#39;s provided those actions don&amp;#39;t infringe upon the natural, negative rights of anyone else. But that&amp;#39;s largely what&amp;#39;s wrong with America....both sides, left AND right, want to tell others how to live. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/3440254957222418897'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/3440254957222418897'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/08/winners-and-losers-in-culture-war.html?showComment=1472748028750#c3440254957222418897' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/08/winners-and-losers-in-culture-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1673734406704355585' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/1673734406704355585' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-410242302"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2016 at 11:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5000590379993122997</id><published>2016-09-01T11:27:41.705-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-01T11:27:41.705-05:00</updated><title type='text'>sometimes mocking is the best solution&#xa;&#xa;</title><content type='html'>sometimes mocking is the best solution&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/5000590379993122997'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/5000590379993122997'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/08/winners-and-losers-in-culture-war.html?showComment=1472747261705#c5000590379993122997' title=''/><author><name>Dr.D</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/08/winners-and-losers-in-culture-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1673734406704355585' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/1673734406704355585' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-935090228"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2016 at 11:27 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-9017725975769343707</id><published>2016-09-01T11:06:42.557-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-01T11:06:42.557-05:00</updated><title type='text'>When this sweet little snowflake is getting gang r...</title><content type='html'>When this sweet little snowflake is getting gang raped by Somalis and Syrian refugees and begs for help, I&amp;#39;ll throw her a dildo (if I happen to have one handy), otherwise, &amp;quot;sucks to be you, sister.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/9017725975769343707'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/9017725975769343707'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/08/winners-and-losers-in-culture-war.html?showComment=1472746002557#c9017725975769343707' title=''/><author><name>keith park</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/08/winners-and-losers-in-culture-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1673734406704355585' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/1673734406704355585' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-160295158"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2016 at 11:06 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3003979945956226510</id><published>2016-09-01T07:26:24.231-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-01T07:26:24.231-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Domino&amp;#39;s stand on the issue was &amp;quot;Chiky-St...</title><content type='html'>Domino&amp;#39;s stand on the issue was &amp;quot;Chiky-Stix, not Tricky Dicks!&amp;quot; I never knew she was so anti-Nixon...&lt;br /&gt;Bill and Domino&lt;br /&gt;III</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/3003979945956226510'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/1673734406704355585/comments/default/3003979945956226510'/><link rel='